The readable documents that `FirSpec.lean` renders with `{includeReadable}`,
one per section on the readable layer (ADR-2026-11-05-2012). They are
imported here, not in `FirSpec.lean`, so that the document stays within the
file-size budget (ADR-2026-10-28-0724) as more sections move. A section
that moves adds the import of its document here.
-/
